==Old Norse==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|non|gem-pro|*hwar||where}}, formed with a locative suffix from the stem of {{m|gem-pro|*hwaz||who}}. Cognate with {{cog|ang|hwær}}, {{cog|ofs|hwēr}}, {{cog|osx|hwar}}, {{cog|odt|war}}, {{m|odt|wara}}, {{cog|goh|war}}, {{cog|got|𐍈𐌰𐍂|tr=[[hwar#Gothic|hwar]]|sc=Goth}}.

===Adverb===
{{non-adv|-}}

# [[where]]

====Descendants====
