* Danish: {{l|da|hvor}}
* Faroese: {{l|fo|hvar}}
* Icelandic: {{l|is|hvar}}
{{mid2}}
* Norwegian Bokmål: {{l|nb|hvor}}
* Norwegian Nynorsk: {{l|nn|kvar}}, {{l|nn|kor}}
* Swedish: {{l|sv|var}}
